From: Fractal Microsystems <bsp@fractalmicro.org>
Subject: [PATCH] modules: preserve configured linker flags

Use AM_LDFLAGS for local additions instead of overriding the distribution's
LDFLAGS, which include hardening and the required ELF hash style.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/src/modules/Makefile.am
+++ b/src/modules/Makefile.am
@@ -30,4 +30,4 @@
-LDFLAGS =
+AM_LDFLAGS =

 if DARWIN_HOST
-LDFLAGS += -Wl,-U,_module_speak -Wl,-U,_module_speak_sync
+AM_LDFLAGS += -Wl,-U,_module_speak -Wl,-U,_module_speak_sync
